@startuml Notifications_Flow

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

title View Notifications Flow

actor User
participant "GoalsScreen" as Goals
participant "AchieviaNavGraph" as Nav
participant "NotificationsScreen" as Notifications
participant "GoalRepository" as Repo

User -> Goals: Open navigation drawer
User -> Goals: Click "Notifications" menu item
Goals -> Nav: onNavigateToNotifications()
activate Nav
Nav -> Notifications: Navigate to NotificationsScreen
activate Notifications
Notifications --> User: Display notifications list

alt Friend Request Notification
    User -> Notifications: Click "Accept" button
    Notifications -> Repo: (Future: Accept friend request)
    Notifications -> Notifications: Remove notification
    Notifications --> User: Update notifications list
else Shared Goal/Task Notification
    User -> Notifications: Click "View" button
    Notifications -> Nav: (Future: Navigate to shared goal)
    Notifications -> Notifications: Remove notification
    Notifications --> User: Update notifications list
end

User -> Notifications: Click dismiss icon
Notifications -> Notifications: Remove notification
Notifications --> User: Update notifications list

User -> Notifications: Click back button
Notifications -> Nav: onNavigateBack()
deactivate Notifications
Nav -> Goals: Return to GoalsScreen
deactivate Nav

note right of Notifications
  Currently uses dummy data.
  Future: Real-time notifications
  from backend when goals/tasks
  are shared or friend requests
  are received
end note

@enduml

